  "description": "Dive into Mario Kart Tour - available for free download and simple installation. Completely secure with no viruses or malware. Always enjoy the latest version effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare for an unprecedented global Mario Kart experience! In Mario Kart Tour, you'll compete against players worldwide in thrilling multiplayer races. Go head-to-head with up to seven opponents in various tailor-made race modes, whether it's solo or team-based, featuring diverse kart speeds and item configurations. Feel the excitement of racing on tracks inspired by real cities and iconic Mario Kart locations. With intuitive one-finger controls, navigate, drift, and unleash powerful items to clinch victory in races filled with both new and classic courses. Gather drivers, karts, and badges to upgrade your collection and showcase your achievements. Tackle special challenge courses that add a creative twist to standard racing, and work to boost your online ranking by demonstrating your racing prowess. Rev your engines and jump into Mario Kart Tour today!",
